                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amulemeke Jehova Leza wanu naatana kumuletela mudima, maulu aanu naatana kulebwa atala lyazilundu zyalundindiwana. Nimuli mukulangila mumuni, inga uyoousandula kuba eenzule calufu amudima uusia mbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele na mwakaka kuswiilila, moyo wangu uyoolila kumbali nkaambo kakulisumpula kwanu, ameso aangu ayoolizya misozi minji loko nkaambo kamatanga aa-Jehova aatolwa mubuzike.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
